  "description": "ToolUp.Graph Neo4j companion — the distributed-tier IGraphStore over the Apache-2.0-licensed Neo4j .NET driver, talking to an externally-operated Neo4j server (single instance or causal cluster). Full openCypher, horizontal read scale-out, multi-database (database-per-tenant) tenant isolation with a property-partition fallback, and cluster transients surfaced as the IGraphStore retryable-result contract. Binds the shared IGraphStoreContract unchanged — a query developed against the in-memory default runs unchanged here. Server-only companion.",
